      "Language": "ita",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Postoperative analgesia and side effects of epidural morphine (3 mg in 5 ml saline) were studied in 30 patients scheduled for Milligan-Morgan surgery. The patients were pain-free for a mean duration of 10-12 hr. Urinary retention was the most prominent side effect observed."},
